## 1. Introduction and Welcome

Welcome to **MedSync Health**! We are thrilled to have you join our team. This Onboarding Guide is designed to provide a structured and comprehensive introduction to our company, culture, and processes. Our goal is to ensure you feel supported and empowered from day one.

This guide outlines the essential steps and resources for your first 90 days. For general employment policies, please refer to **HR-001: Employee Handbook**.

